      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1214,
      "text": "Their case is like the people of Pharaoh and those who came before them. They rejected the signs of their Lord, so We destroyed them[31] for their sins and drowned the people of Pharaoh; they were all wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 152,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1215,
      "text": "The worst of moving creatures[32] before Allah are those who persist in disbelief, so they do not believe,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 152,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1216,
      "text": "those with whom you [O Prophet] made a treaty, but they break their treaty every time, and they do not fear Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 152,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1217,
      "text": "If you encounter them in battle, make a fearsome example of them[33] for those who are behind them, so that they may be deterred.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 152,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1218,
      "text": "If you fear betrayal from any people, throw their treaty back at them openly[34], for Allah does not like the treacherous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 152,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1219,
      "text": "The disbelievers should not think that they are unreachable; they cannot escape.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 153,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1220,
      "text": "Prepare against them whatever force[35] you can and cavalry, to deter Allah’s enemies and your enemies[36], and others besides them whom you do not know[37], but Allah knows them. Whatever you spend[38] in the cause of Allah will be repaid to you in full, and you will not be wronged.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 10,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 184,
      "ruku": 153,
      "hizbQuarter": 73,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1221,
      "text": "If they incline to peace, then incline to it, and put your trust in Allah, for He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.",
